WEBVTT

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:33.297
Maybe I'm not capable
of being a good mom to two kids."

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:38.886
I decided to post a joke video
on TikTok one day

00:01:38.886 --> 00:01:40.930
about my house-turned-disaster.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:43.349
(Laughter)

00:01:43.349 --> 00:01:46.727
Some funny shots
of my clutter and my dishes

00:01:46.769 --> 00:01:50.148
and my enchilada pan to a nice beat.

00:01:51.315 --> 00:01:54.193
Sort of a laugh to keep
from cry situation, surely.

00:01:54.902 --> 00:01:56.487
And I got a comment.

00:01:58.948 --> 00:02:00.158
"Lazy."